<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Evaluación Interactiva - Religión 6°</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4A90E2;
            --secondary: #50E3C2;
            --danger: #E94E77;
            --success: #27AE60;
            --bg: #F4F7F6;
            --text: #333;
            --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0eafc 0%, #cfdef3 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            color: var(--text);
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Pantallas */
        .screen {
            display: none;
            padding: 40px;
            animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease;
        }

        .screen.active {
            display: block;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* Pantalla de Inicio */
        .start-screen {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .start-screen h1 {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .start-screen p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .rules-box {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .rules-box ul {
            list-style-type: none;
        }

        .rules-box li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .rules-box li::before {
            content: '📌';
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        .btn {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(74, 144, 226, 0.3);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #357ABD;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 7px 20px rgba(74, 144, 226, 0.4);
        }

        /* Encabezado del Quiz */
        .quiz-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;
        }

        .progress-container {
            width: 100%;
            background: #eee;
            height: 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .progress-bar {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            width: 0%;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        .question-text {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Grid de 2 columnas para 8 opciones */
        .options-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .option {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border: 2px solid #e9ecef;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .option:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: #f0f7ff;
        }

        .option.selected {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: #e6f0ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(74, 144, 226, 0.2);
        }

        .option.correct {
            background: #d4edda;
            border-color: var(--success);
            color: #155724;
        }

        .option.incorrect {
            background: #f8d7da;
            border-color: var(--danger);
            color: #721c24;
        }

        .option-letter {
            background: #fff;
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 12px;
            border: 2px solid #dee2e6;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .option.selected .option-letter {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }

        .feedback {
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: none;
            animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .feedback.show {
            display: block;
        }

        .feedback.success {
            background: #d4edda;
            color: var(--success);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--success);
        }

        .feedback.error {
            background: #f8d7da;
            color: var(--danger);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--danger);
        }

        .btn-next {
            margin-top: 20px;
            float: right;
            display: none;
        }

        .btn-next.show {
            display: inline-block;
        }

        /* Pantalla de Resultados */
        .result-screen {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .result-icon {
            font-size: 5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .result-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .result-score {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn-restart {
            background: var(--secondary);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(80, 227, 194, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-restart:hover {
            background: #3bc9a9;
            box-shadow: 0 7px 20px rgba(80, 227, 194, 0.4);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .options-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr; /* 1 columna en móviles */
            }
            .screen { padding: 20px; }
            .start-screen h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
            .question-text { font-size: 1.1rem; }
            .option { padding: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <!-- Pantalla de Inicio -->
    <div id="start-screen" class="screen active start-screen">
        <h1>Evaluación de Religión</h1>
        <p>Demuestra cuánto has aprendido sobre las relaciones de Jesús, sus rasgos, el proyecto de Dios y la Virgen María.</p>
        
        <div class="rules-box">
            <ul>
                <li>La prueba consta de <strong>10 preguntas</strong> aleatorias.</li>
                <li>Cada pregunta tiene <strong>8 opciones</strong> de respuesta (¡lee con cuidado!).</li>
                <li>Necesitas <strong>9 respuestas correctas</strong> para aprobar (pierdes con 2 fallos).</li>
                <li>Solo tienes <strong>una oportunidad</strong> por pregunta.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <button class="btn" onclick="startQuiz()">Comenzar Evaluación</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Pantalla del Quiz -->
    <div id="quiz-screen" class="screen">
        <div class="quiz-header">
            <span id="question-counter" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary);">Pregunta 1 de 10</span>
            <span id="score-display" style="font-weight: 600;">Aciertos: 0 | Fallos: 0</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="progress-container">
            <div id="progress-bar" class="progress-bar"></div>
        </div>

        <div id="question-text" class="question-text">Cargando pregunta...</div>
        
        <div id="options-container" class="options-container">
            <!-- Las 8 opciones se generan dinámicamente -->
        </div>

        <div id="feedback" class="feedback"></div>
        
        <button id="btn-next" class="btn btn-next" onclick="nextQuestion()">Siguiente Pregunta</button>
        <div style="clear: both;"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pantalla de Resultados -->
    <div id="result-screen" class="screen result-screen">
        <div id="result-icon" class="result-icon">🎉</div>
        <h2 id="result-title" class="result-title">¡Felicidades!</h2>
        <p id="result-score" class="result-score">Has acertado 10 de 10 preguntas.</p>
        <p id="result-message" style="margin-bottom: 30px; color: #666;"></p>
        <button class="btn btn-restart" onclick="location.reload()">Volver a Intentar</button>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
